{"suttaId":"tha-ap262","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8378,8398],"vripara":"37"},"segments":{"tha-ap262:0.3":"Aggapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap262:1.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, nisinnaṃ pabbatantare;","tha-ap262:1.3":"Obhāsayantaṃ raṃsena [raṃsiyā (syā.)], sikhinaṃ sikhinaṃ yathā.","tha-ap262:2.1":"“Aggajaṃ pupphamādāya, upāgacchiṃ naruttamaṃ;","tha-ap262:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap262:3.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap262:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap262:4.1":"“Pañcavīsatikappamhi, ahosi amitogato [amitavhayo (sī.)];","tha-ap262:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap262:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap262:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā aggapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap262:7.1":"Aggapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap262:8.1":"Thomakavaggo chabbīsatimo.","tha-ap262:9.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap262:10.1":"Thomakekāsanacitakaṃ, campako sattapāṭali;","tha-ap262:10.3":"Pānadhi [pāhano (sī.), pādu (syā.)] mañjarī paṇṇaṃ, kuṭido aggapupphiyo;","tha-ap262:10.5":"Gāthāyo gaṇitā cettha, ekatālīsameva cāti."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3218,"to":3218,"paras":[{"para":3218,"vripara":"37-38","refs":["tha-ap262:1"],"words":["obhāsayantaṃ","sikhinaṃ sikhinaṃ yathā"],"lines":["37-38. Dasamāpadāne <b>sikhinaṃ sikhinaṃ yathā</b>ti sarīrato nikkhantachabbaṇṇaraṃsīhi <b>obhāsayantaṃ</b> jalantaṃ sikhīnaṃ sikhībhagavantaṃ sikhīnaṃ yathā jalamānaaggikkhandhaṃ viya.","<b>Aggajaṃ pupphamādāyā</b>ti aggajanāmakaṃ pupphaṃ gahetvā <b>buddhassa</b> sikhissa bhagavato <b>abhiropayiṃ</b> pūjesinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap262:1"],["tha-ap262:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
